  "bio": "Laura Rachel is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Atlanta, United States, specializing in illustrative, watercolor, and fine line tattoos. Her intricate and vibrant creations reflect her adeptness at energy healing through art, offering a unique and profound experience for clients seeking more than just a tattoo. Renowned for her professionalism, Laura ensures that every session is not only a testament to her artistic talent but also a demonstration of her commitment to providing a comfortable and meticulous environment for her clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Atlanta, Georgia, United States\n\nTaking time to care for family.  On hiatus but occasionally available.",
